{"synopsis":"Lima tahun lalu, sebuah bencana besar menghancurkan kehidupan damai umat manusia hanya dalam satu hari. Sejak saat itu, muncullah “Zona Khusus” misterius di berbagai penjuru dunia, masing-masing dengan tingkat kesulitannya sendiri.\n\nMaya Ichijo, yang hampir berhasil menaklukkan semua 100 zona untuk meraih gelar “Grand Slam,” dikhianati oleh rekan-rekannya sendiri dan terbunuh di ujian terakhir.\n\nNamun, di napas terakhirnya… ia justru terbangun kembali di dunia sebelum bencana itu terjadi.\n\nKini, berbekal semua ingatan dari kehidupannya yang lalu, ia bersumpah akan menuntut balas—\nkarena di dunia ini, monster sebenarnya bukanlah para zombie… melainkan manusia.","alternative_title":"リベンジャー：終末の復讐","author":"COBI","artist":"HNS Studio, COBI","chapters":[{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"b2a282fe-4194-41a9-817e-b2f257e7b7ac","date":"2026-04-18","images":[]},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"bfff8595-134e-43bc-b876-c161922e7d94","date":"2026-03-25","images":[]},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"26859754-b90d-4aba-8d73-4105a9879188","date":"2026-03-22","images":[]},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"46075ab5-9f37-4c15-8b97-cc631329eac2","date":"2026-03-12","images":[]},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"a07aff95-51ad-4c51-9fdf-3c43ab3bd19a","date":"2026-03-11","images":[]},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"b55ef8a6-8cd4-44ec-9438-ec27e55e6928","date":"2026-03-08","images":[]},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"5fd901aa-a048-4f86-837b-508a6636d85e","date":"2026-03-05","images":[]},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"96130bf2-f4e8-428d-b650-1c7533428677","date":"2026-03-03","images":[]},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"b77ffa6f-5666-41c9-b89f-8c7f59ec7c52","date":"2026-03-02","images":[]},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"6fe750c7-cd32-43b1-9089-8e8d590b8d33","date":"2026-03-01","images":[]},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"21968d7e-b87c-4319-b881-5409a11a1a71","date":"2026-02-23","images":[]},{"number":"23","chapt